each qualifier and open reads the class its own module gives a name: true
a qualified builder call uses the IR surface: true
linking for an operand helper alone uses nothing of the IR surface: true
an alias of the harness reaches the IR surface: true
an alias of the public builder tier reaches the IR surface: true
an unqualified builder counts only under an open of the harness: true
a local open covers its body alone: true
a name the file binds for itself is not taken for the builder under an open: true
only an exact harness path is the harness, not a same-named nested module: true
a test's own binding shadows an open only where it is in scope, and a later open shadows it: true
a constrained alias of the harness is still the harness: true
