a class-expression open of the harness reaches its builders: true
an unreadable open after the harness's does not hide its builders: true
an alias counts only where it is in scope and not rebound: true
a sibling stanza's harness does not cover this module: true
default module membership links the owning harness: true
ordered-set exclusion prevents harness membership: true
a new subdirectory in either package is in scope: true
shipping scanner refuses the first unlinked record builder: true
shipping scanner accepts adoption without golden churn: true
shipping scanner prints the derived operand helpers that adopt nothing: true
linking ll_test for an operand helper alone retires nothing: true
