an unowned copy source inherits its destination harness: true
copied targets enter default module ownership: true
a linked original cannot hide an unlinked copied consumer: true
short copy_files# retains source ownership: true
literal copy chains retain every consumer: true
an unlinked consumer at the end of a copy chain is refused: true
unsupported copy globs are refused explicitly: true
copy inputs outside the declared corpus are refused explicitly: true
